    "应用要求：紧凑化与集成，长寿命与耐久性，低温可靠；\n电容作用：滤波，\n永铭产品优势：\n高容量密度同尺寸给予给大的容量，提升整机性能与耐久；\n双电解质赋予电容更好的低温性能，满足整机-55℃低温依旧稳定；": "Application requirements: compactness and integration, long life and durability, low temperature reliability;\nCapacitor function: filtering,\nYongming product advantages:\nThe high capacity density gives a large capacity in the same size, improving the performance and durability of the entire machine;\nThe dual electrolytes give the capacitor better low-temperature performance, allowing the whole machine to remain stable at -55°C;",
