    "2，高能量密度；①D壳尺寸下容值可达820μF 2V。②确保有限的空间内提供足 够的电荷储备；": "2. High energy density; ①The capacitance value under D shell size can reach 820μF 2V. ② Ensure sufficient charge reserve in a limited space;",
    "3，高温度可靠性；①-55℃~+105℃容量变化不超过5% ②长期工作后容量变化不 超过-10%确保服务器在7×24小时高负荷、高温环境下稳定运 行，降低故障率和维护需求，适 应数据中心严苛环境；高温可靠性强，长期工作后容量变化不 超过-10%确保服务器在7×24小时高负荷、高温环境下稳定运  行，降低故障率和维护需求，适应数据中心严苛环境；": "3. High temperature reliability; ① -55℃~+105℃ capacity change does not exceed 5% ② After long-term operation, the capacity change does not exceed -10% to ensure stable operation of the server in 7×24 hours high load and high temperature environment, reduce failure rate and maintenance requirements, and adapt to the harsh environment of the data center; strong high temperature reliability, after long-term operation, the capacity change does not exceed -10% to ensure stable operation of the server in 7×24 hours high load and high temperature environment operation, reduce failure rate and maintenance requirements, and adapt to the harsh environment of the data center;",
    "4，高频特性优异；①适应100~300KHz高频率②保证服务器在不同温度情况下 高频滤波性能保持一致，系统设": "4. Excellent high-frequency characteristics; ① adapt to high frequencies of 100~300KHz ② ensure that the high-frequency filtering performance of the server remains consistent under different temperatures. System design",
