    "AI服务器存储": "AI server storage",
    "SSD企业级固态硬盘": "SSD Enterprise Solid State Drive",
    "PLP 电路供电输入端": "PLP circuit power supply input terminal",
    "位于SSD供电接口与PLP掉电保护电路、主控电路之间，是SSD供电的一级滤波节点，同时在掉电时为PLP电路提供储能支撑，保障缓存数据写入与掉电保护执行。\n\n对电容的要求：异常断电保护(PLP)的可靠性；耐高频开关冲击；高温环境下的长寿命与稳定性；高耐纹波电流能力；高可靠性与一致性；\n\n电容核心作用：输入供电滤波、PLP掉电保护储能、抗电压波动\n\n永铭固液混合铝电解优势：\n1，掉电保护；固混电容可以提供毫秒级断电保护，超低ESR确保能量高效释放，完美满足PLP需求；\n2，耐开关冲击；永铭固混电容可耐受30万次充放电；\n3，高温长寿命；采用固液混合技术，从根本上解决了电解液干涸问题，在125℃高温下寿命4000小时，远超Al服务器 的预期工作年限；\n4，固液混合电容具有高耐纹波电流能力，能保持系统在重载下的稳定；\n5，高可靠性、一致性；永铭通过智能化生产线和数字化管理平台，严格品控，提供高质量、一致性好的产品，满足企业级客  户对可靠性的极致追求；\n\n永铭钽电容产品优势：\n1，超高容量密度；具备极致的体积效率，在SSD“寸土寸金”的板 卡上，以最小的物理尺寸提供最大的单位体 积容量，释放了宝贵的布局空间，同时满足 掉电保护的能量需求。\n2，掉电保护的即时性；既能实现毫秒级的快速能量释放，满足掉电 保护需求；又有效抑制了正常上电时的浪涌 电流，从而完美支持热插拔等关键功能，提 升了系统应用的坚固性与安全性。\n3，宽温稳定&高可靠性；部分系列产品可通过双85测试1000小时，并 在20000次充放电循环后，容量衰减仍小于 15%。其卓越的长期耐高温与抗老化性能，为 数据的绝对安全与系统长期可靠性提供了坚 实保障。": "Located between the SSD power supply interface, the PLP power-down protection circuit and the main control circuit, it is the first-level filtering node for the SSD power supply. It also provides energy storage support for the PLP circuit during power-down, ensuring cache data writing and power-down protection execution.\n\nRequirements for capacitors: reliability of abnormal power failure protection (PLP); resistance to high-frequency switching shock; long life and stability in high temperature environments; high ripple current resistance; high reliability and consistency;\n\nCore functions of capacitors: input power supply filtering, PLP power-off protection energy storage, and resistance to voltage fluctuations\n\nAdvantages of Yongming solid-liquid mixed aluminum electrolysis:\n1. Power-off protection; solid hybrid capacitors can provide millisecond-level power-off protection, and ultra-low ESR ensures efficient energy release, perfectly meeting PLP needs;\n2. Resistant to switching impact; Yongming solid hybrid capacitors can withstand 300,000 charges and discharges;\n3. High temperature and long life; using solid-liquid mixing technology, it fundamentally solves the problem of electrolyte drying out, with a lifespan of 4,000 hours at a high temperature of 125°C, far exceeding the expected working life of the Al server;\n4. The solid-liquid hybrid capacitor has high ripple current resistance and can maintain the stability of the system under heavy load;\n5. High reliability and consistency; Yongming implements strict quality control through intelligent production lines and digital management platforms to provide high-quality and consistent products to meet the ultimate pursuit of reliability by enterprise-level customers;\n\nAdvantages of Yongming tantalum capacitor products:\n1. Ultra-high capacity density; with ultimate volume efficiency, it provides the largest unit volume capacity with the smallest physical size on SSD boards where every inch of space is precious, freeing up valuable layout space while meeting the energy requirements for power-off protection.\n2. The immediacy of power-down protection; it can not only achieve millisecond-level rapid energy release to meet the needs of power-down protection; it also effectively suppresses the surge current during normal power-on, thus perfectly supporting key functions such as hot swapping and improving the robustness and safety of system applications.\n3. Wide temperature stability & high reliability; some series of products can pass the double 85 test for 1,000 hours, and after 20,000 charge and discharge cycles, the capacity attenuation is still less than 15%. Its excellent long-term high temperature resistance and anti-aging properties provide a solid guarantee for the absolute security of data and long-term system reliability.",
    "位于SSD供电接口与PLP掉电保护电路、主控电路之间，是SSD供电的一级滤波节点，同时在掉电时为PLP电路提供储能支撑，保障缓存数据写入与掉电保护执行。": "Located between the SSD power supply interface, the PLP power-down protection circuit and the main control circuit, it is the first-level filtering node for the SSD power supply. It also provides energy storage support for the PLP circuit during power-down, ensuring cache data writing and power-down protection execution.",
