    "3，宽温稳定&高可靠性；部分系列产品可通过双85测试1000小时，并 在20000次充放电循环后，容量衰减仍小于 15%。其卓越的长期耐高温与抗老化性能，为 数据的绝对安全与系统长期可靠性提供了坚 实保障。": "3. Wide temperature stability & high reliability; some series of products can pass the double 85 test for 1,000 hours, and after 20,000 charge and discharge cycles, the capacity attenuation is still less than 15%. Its excellent long-term high temperature resistance and anti-aging properties provide a solid guarantee for the absolute security of data and long-term system reliability.",
    "机器人": "robot",
