    "面向机器人关节模组、雷达/摄像头感知系统及高压输入滤波，提供高容量密度、低ESR和高可靠性的电容方案。": "Provides capacitor solutions with high capacity density, low ESR and high reliability for robot joint modules, radar/camera sensing systems and high-voltage input filtering.",
