    "母线直流支持": "Bus DC support",
    "滤波稳压‌：吸收逆变环节高频开关产生的纹波电流，平滑直流母线电压，为电机提供稳定的电能输入。\n‌浪涌与瞬态响应‌:凭借耐大电流冲击的特性，承受电机启动时的浪涌电流，同时提供瞬时大电流，快速响应电机功率突变的需求。\n‌储能缓冲‌:短时间储存电荷，在负载波动时维持电压稳定，避免电压尖峰损坏电调内部的功率器件。\n‌抑制干扰‌:消除电源与负载间的低频噪声耦合，减少电路间的干扰，提升电调整体运行稳定性": "Filtering and voltage stabilization‌: absorbs the ripple current generated by high-frequency switching in the inverter link, smoothes the DC bus voltage, and provides stable power input to the motor.\n‌Surge and Transient Response‌: With its resistance to large current shocks, it can withstand the surge current when the motor starts, while providing instantaneous large current to quickly respond to sudden changes in motor power.\n‌Energy storage buffer‌: Stores charge for a short period of time, maintains voltage stability when the load fluctuates, and prevents voltage spikes from damaging the power devices inside the ESC.\n‌Interference Suppression‌: Eliminate the low-frequency noise coupling between the power supply and the load, reduce the interference between circuits, and improve the overall operation stability of the ESC.",
    "滤波稳压‌：吸收逆变环节高频开关产生的纹波电流，平滑直流母线电压，为电机提供稳定的电能输入。": "Filtering and voltage stabilization‌: absorbs the ripple current generated by high-frequency switching in the inverter link, smoothes the DC bus voltage, and provides stable power input to the motor.",
    "‌浪涌与瞬态响应‌:凭借耐大电流冲击的特性，承受电机启动时的浪涌电流，同时提供瞬时大电流，快速响应电机功率突变的需求。": "‌Surge and Transient Response‌: With its resistance to large current shocks, it can withstand the surge current when the motor starts, while providing instantaneous large current to quickly respond to sudden changes in motor power.",
    "‌储能缓冲‌:短时间储存电荷，在负载波动时维持电压稳定，避免电压尖峰损坏电调内部的功率器件。": "‌Energy storage buffer‌: Stores charge for a short period of time, maintains voltage stability when the load fluctuates, and prevents voltage spikes from damaging the power devices inside the ESC.",
    "‌抑制干扰‌:消除电源与负载间的低频噪声耦合，减少电路间的干扰，提升电调整体运行稳定性": "‌Interference Suppression‌: Eliminate the low-frequency noise coupling between the power supply and the load, reduce the interference between circuits, and improve the overall operation stability of the ESC.",
