    "应用要求‌：适配DSP芯片瞬时大电流突变的供电需求，避免芯片因供电波动出现算力不足、数据丢包。\n‌电容作用‌：快速响应DSP核心的瞬态功率波动，滤除芯片工作产生的高频回流噪声，维持核心供电电压稳定。\n‌YMIN产品优势‌：推荐VHT系列固液混合电容，超低ESR特性可实现纳秒级瞬态响应，在狭小空间内实现高容值滤波，保障雷达点云数据、摄像头图像数据传输零丢包。": "Application requirements‌: Adapt to the power supply needs of the DSP chip due to instantaneous large current changes, and avoid the chip's insufficient computing power and data packet loss due to power supply fluctuations.\n‌Capacitor function‌: Quickly respond to the transient power fluctuation of the DSP core, filter out the high-frequency reflow noise generated by the chip operation, and maintain the stability of the core power supply voltage.\n‌YMIN product advantages‌: VHT series solid-liquid hybrid capacitors are recommended. The ultra-low ESR characteristics can achieve nanosecond-level transient response, achieve high-capacitance filtering in a small space, and ensure zero packet loss in the transmission of radar point cloud data and camera image data.",
    "应用要求‌：适配DSP芯片瞬时大电流突变的供电需求，避免芯片因供电波动出现算力不足、数据丢包。": "Application requirements‌: Adapt to the power supply needs of the DSP chip due to instantaneous large current changes, and avoid the chip's insufficient computing power and data packet loss due to power supply fluctuations.",
    "‌电容作用‌：快速响应DSP核心的瞬态功率波动，滤除芯片工作产生的高频回流噪声，维持核心供电电压稳定。": "‌Capacitor function‌: Quickly respond to the transient power fluctuation of the DSP core, filter out the high-frequency reflow noise generated by the chip operation, and maintain the stability of the core power supply voltage.",
    "‌YMIN产品优势‌：推荐VHT系列固液混合电容，超低ESR特性可实现纳秒级瞬态响应，在狭小空间内实现高容值滤波，保障雷达点云数据、摄像头图像数据传输零丢包。": "‌YMIN product advantages‌: VHT series solid-liquid hybrid capacitors are recommended. The ultra-low ESR characteristics can achieve nanosecond-level transient response, achieve high-capacitance filtering in a small space, and ensure zero packet loss in the transmission of radar point cloud data and camera image data.",
    "机器人电源模块": "Robot power module",
    "高压输入滤波": "High voltage input filter",
    "应用要求‌：在高压输入侧实现EMI抑制，同时耐受高浪涌冲击，满足整机小型化、高能量密度的设计需求。\n‌电容作用‌：吸收高压输入侧的瞬态尖峰与电网浪涌，滤除输入共模/差模噪声，为后级所有电路提供安全、纯净的输入电源。\n‌YMIN产品优势‌：固液混合高压电容的容量密度是传统铝电解电容的3倍，在更小体积下实现大容值滤波，可配合LC滤波网络完成高效EMI抑制，同时耐受高输入浪涌冲击，完美匹配电源模块高能量密度、小型化的设计目标。": "Application requirements‌: Achieve EMI suppression on the high-voltage input side, while withstanding high surge impacts, meeting the design requirements for miniaturization and high energy density of the entire machine.\n‌Capacitor function‌: Absorb transient spikes and power grid surges on the high-voltage input side, filter out input common mode/differential mode noise, and provide safe and pure input power for all subsequent circuits.\n‌YMIN Product Advantages‌: The capacity density of solid-liquid hybrid high-voltage capacitors is 3 times that of traditional aluminum electrolytic capacitors. It can achieve large-capacitance filtering in a smaller size. It can be used with the LC filter network to achieve efficient EMI suppression while withstanding high input surge impacts. It perfectly matches the design goals of high energy density and miniaturization of power modules.",
    "应用要求‌：在高压输入侧实现EMI抑制，同时耐受高浪涌冲击，满足整机小型化、高能量密度的设计需求。": "Application requirements‌: Achieve EMI suppression on the high-voltage input side, while withstanding high surge impacts, meeting the design requirements for miniaturization and high energy density of the entire machine.",
    "‌电容作用‌：吸收高压输入侧的瞬态尖峰与电网浪涌，滤除输入共模/差模噪声，为后级所有电路提供安全、纯净的输入电源。": "‌Capacitor function‌: Absorb transient spikes and power grid surges on the high-voltage input side, filter out input common mode/differential mode noise, and provide safe and pure input power for all subsequent circuits.",
    "‌YMIN产品优势‌：固液混合高压电容的容量密度是传统铝电解电容的3倍，在更小体积下实现大容值滤波，可配合LC滤波网络完成高效EMI抑制，同时耐受高输入浪涌冲击，完美匹配电源模块高能量密度、小型化的设计目标。": "‌YMIN Product Advantages‌: The capacity density of solid-liquid hybrid high-voltage capacitors is 3 times that of traditional aluminum electrolytic capacitors. It can achieve large-capacitance filtering in a smaller size. It can be used with the LC filter network to achieve efficient EMI suppression while withstanding high input surge impacts. It perfectly matches the design goals of high energy density and miniaturization of power modules.",
