    "无人机": "drone",
    "无人机应用指南": "Drone Application Guide",
    "面向无人机电子调速器与航点飞行调参，提供适用于滤波、储能和稳定供电的电容方案。": "For UAV electronic speed regulator and waypoint flight parameter adjustment, we provide capacitor solutions suitable for filtering, energy storage and stable power supply.",
    "大纹波": "large ripple",
    "高能量密度": "high energy density",
    "无人机电子调速器": "Drone electronic speed controller",
    "电子调速器": "Electronic speed regulator",
    "电子调速器电路拓扑图": "Electronic speed regulator circuit topology diagram",
    "滤波稳压‌：吸收逆变环节高频开关产生的纹波电流，平滑直流母线电压，为电机提供稳定的电能输入。\n‌浪涌与瞬态响应‌:凭借耐大电流冲击的特性，承受电机启动时的浪涌电流，同时提供瞬时大电流，快速响应电机功率突变的需求。\n‌储能缓冲‌:短时间储存电荷，在负载波动时维持电压稳定，避免电压尖峰损坏电调内部的功率器件。\n‌抑制干扰‌:消除电源与负载间的低频噪声耦合，减少电路间的干扰，提升电调整体运行稳定性\n\n\n\n‌耐压裕量‌：耐压值需达到电路最大工作电压的1.2~2倍，应对方波驱动产生的电压尖峰，避免过压击穿。\n‌低等效串联电阻（ESR）‌：ESR需控制在20mΩ及以下，降低大电流下的发热损耗，保障滤波效率。\n‌高纹波电流能力‌：单体纹波电流需达到5500mA级别，可承载穿越机急加速等场景下的数百安培毫秒级瞬时峰值电流": "Filtering and voltage stabilization‌: absorbs the ripple current generated by high-frequency switching in the inverter link, smoothes the DC bus voltage, and provides stable power input to the motor.\n‌Surge and Transient Response‌: With its resistance to large current shocks, it can withstand the surge current when the motor starts, while providing instantaneous large current to quickly respond to sudden changes in motor power.\n‌Energy storage buffer‌: Stores charge for a short period of time, maintains voltage stability when the load fluctuates, and prevents voltage spikes from damaging the power devices inside the ESC.\n‌Interference Suppression‌: Eliminate the low-frequency noise coupling between the power supply and the load, reduce the interference between circuits, and improve the overall operation stability of the ESC.\n\n\n\n‌Withstand voltage margin‌: The withstand voltage value needs to reach 1.2~2 times the maximum operating voltage of the circuit to deal with the voltage spikes generated by the square wave drive and avoid overvoltage breakdown.\n‌Low equivalent series resistance (ESR)‌: ESR needs to be controlled at 20mΩ and below to reduce heating loss under large current and ensure filtering efficiency.\n‌High ripple current capability‌: The single ripple current needs to reach the 5500mA level, which can carry hundreds of amps of millisecond-level instantaneous peak current in scenarios such as rapid acceleration of the traversing machine.",
    "‌耐压裕量‌：耐压值需达到电路最大工作电压的1.2~2倍，应对方波驱动产生的电压尖峰，避免过压击穿。": "‌Withstand voltage margin‌: The withstand voltage value needs to reach 1.2~2 times the maximum operating voltage of the circuit to deal with the voltage spikes generated by the square wave drive and avoid overvoltage breakdown.",
    "‌低等效串联电阻（ESR）‌：ESR需控制在20mΩ及以下，降低大电流下的发热损耗，保障滤波效率。": "‌Low equivalent series resistance (ESR)‌: ESR needs to be controlled at 20mΩ and below to reduce heating loss under large current and ensure filtering efficiency.",
    "‌高纹波电流能力‌：单体纹波电流需达到5500mA级别，可承载穿越机急加速等场景下的数百安培毫秒级瞬时峰值电流": "‌High ripple current capability‌: The single ripple current needs to reach the 5500mA level, which can carry hundreds of amps of millisecond-level instantaneous peak current in scenarios such as rapid acceleration of the traversing machine.",
    "无人机航点飞行调参": "UAV waypoint flight parameter adjustment",
    "航点飞行调参": "Waypoint flight parameters adjustment",
    "集成化小型化：集成飞行控制、导航、通信等功能，减轻重量，提升性能。\n高可靠性高精度：在恶劣环境中保持稳定工作，确保飞行的精度和安全性。特别是在复杂的飞行 任务中，需要高精度的姿态控制和稳定的飞行性能。\n高能效 低功耗：随着无人机对电池续航的依赖性增强，控制器系统的功耗也成为一个关键问 题。控制器需要具备高效能的同时，确保低功耗以延长无人机的飞行时间。\n抗干扰抗震：控制器需要具备较强的抗干扰能力，能够有效应对环境中出现的各种电磁干扰及噪声，保持飞行的稳定性。同时，控制器应具备抗震能力，防止由于振动对飞行控制精度的影响。": "Integration and miniaturization: Integrate flight control, navigation, communication and other functions to reduce weight and improve performance.\nHigh reliability and high precision: Maintain stable operation in harsh environments to ensure flight accuracy and safety. Especially in complex flight missions, high-precision attitude control and stable flight performance are required.\nHigh energy efficiency and low power consumption: As drones become more dependent on battery life, the power consumption of the controller system has also become a key issue. The controller needs to have high performance while ensuring low power consumption to extend the flight time of the drone.\nAnti-interference and earthquake resistance: The controller needs to have strong anti-interference ability and can effectively deal with various electromagnetic interference and noises in the environment to maintain flight stability. At the same time, the controller should have earthquake resistance to prevent vibration from affecting flight control accuracy.",
    "集成化小型化：集成飞行控制、导航、通信等功能，减轻重量，提升性能。": "Integration and miniaturization: Integrate flight control, navigation, communication and other functions to reduce weight and improve performance.",
    "高可靠性高精度：在恶劣环境中保持稳定工作，确保飞行的精度和安全性。特别是在复杂的飞行 任务中，需要高精度的姿态控制和稳定的飞行性能。": "High reliability and high precision: Maintain stable operation in harsh environments to ensure flight accuracy and safety. Especially in complex flight missions, high-precision attitude control and stable flight performance are required.",
    "高能效 低功耗：随着无人机对电池续航的依赖性增强，控制器系统的功耗也成为一个关键问 题。控制器需要具备高效能的同时，确保低功耗以延长无人机的飞行时间。": "High energy efficiency and low power consumption: As drones become more dependent on battery life, the power consumption of the controller system has also become a key issue. The controller needs to have high performance while ensuring low power consumption to extend the flight time of the drone.",
    "抗干扰抗震：控制器需要具备较强的抗干扰能力，能够有效应对环境中出现的各种电磁干扰及噪声，保持飞行的稳定性。同时，控制器应具备抗震能力，防止由于振动对飞行控制精度的影响。": "Anti-interference and earthquake resistance: The controller needs to have strong anti-interference ability and can effectively deal with various electromagnetic interference and noises in the environment to maintain flight stability. At the same time, the controller should have earthquake resistance to prevent vibration from affecting flight control accuracy.",
