    "高容量密度品，小型化大容量；适合小型化高功率的需求；低漏电流产品，低静态功耗；电池续航更保证；": "High capacity density products, miniaturization and large capacity; suitable for miniaturization and high power requirements; low leakage current products, low static power consumption; battery life is guaranteed;",
    "大电流充放电双向拓扑": "High current charge and discharge bidirectional topology",
    "宽频范围内保持低ER;整机BC更可控；宽温范围内电性能稳定；保证整机户外运行稳定；耐受超大电流冲击，单体电容耐受冲击电流高达30A以上确保高负载高功率的工况下电容能够正常工作且性能稳定。\n高功率密度架构，适配小体积大容量需求，低静态功耗设计保障长续航；全工况下宽温域大电流充放电可控，搭载BMS主动均衡与多重硬件保护，满功率户外运行无压力，-40℃~85℃宽温环境下可稳定输出，长期循环无容量下降问题。": "Maintain low ER in a wide frequency range; the BC of the whole machine is more controllable; the electrical performance is stable in a wide temperature range; ensuring stable outdoor operation of the whole machine; it can withstand ultra-large current surges, and the single capacitor can withstand surge currents up to 30A or more, ensuring that the capacitor can work normally and have stable performance under high load and high power conditions.\nThe high power density architecture adapts to the needs of small size and large capacity, and the low static power consumption design ensures long battery life; the large current charge and discharge can be controlled in a wide temperature range under all working conditions. It is equipped with BMS active balancing and multiple hardware protections. It can operate at full power without pressure in outdoor environments. It can achieve stable output in a wide temperature environment of -40℃~85℃, and there is no problem of capacity degradation during long-term cycles.",
    "宽频范围内保持低ER;整机BC更可控；宽温范围内电性能稳定；保证整机户外运行稳定；耐受超大电流冲击，单体电容耐受冲击电流高达30A以上确保高负载高功率的工况下电容能够正常工作且性能稳定。": "Maintain low ER in a wide frequency range; the BC of the whole machine is more controllable; the electrical performance is stable in a wide temperature range; ensuring stable outdoor operation of the whole machine; it can withstand ultra-large current surges, and the single capacitor can withstand surge currents up to 30A or more, ensuring that the capacitor can work normally and have stable performance under high load and high power conditions.",
    "高功率密度架构，适配小体积大容量需求，低静态功耗设计保障长续航；全工况下宽温域大电流充放电可控，搭载BMS主动均衡与多重硬件保护，满功率户外运行无压力，-40℃~85℃宽温环境下可稳定输出，长期循环无容量下降问题。": "The high power density architecture adapts to the needs of small size and large capacity, and the low static power consumption design ensures long battery life; the large current charge and discharge can be controlled in a wide temperature range under all working conditions. It is equipped with BMS active balancing and multiple hardware protections. It can operate at full power without pressure in outdoor environments. It can achieve stable output in a wide temperature environment of -40℃~85℃, and there is no problem of capacity degradation during long-term cycles.",
    "高速电摩": "High speed electric motorcycle",
    "宽频范围内保持低ESR;整机EMC可控；宽温范围内电性能稳定；保证整机户外运行稳定；耐受超大电流冲击，单体电容耐受冲击电流高达30A以上确保高负载高功率的工况下电容能够正常工作且性能稳定。\n高集成度小体积设计适配轻量化需求，低损耗架构降低发热提升续航表现；全温域内大电流充放电，搭载硬件级过流、过压双重锁止保护，适配户外复杂工况，满负载连续运行无器件过热失效风险。": "Low ESR is maintained in a wide frequency range; the EMC of the whole machine is controllable; the electrical performance is stable in a wide temperature range; the outdoor operation of the whole machine is guaranteed to be stable; it can withstand ultra-large current shocks, and the single capacitor can withstand shock currents up to 30A or more, ensuring that the capacitor can work normally and have stable performance under high load and high power conditions.\nThe highly integrated, small-volume design meets lightweight requirements, and the low-loss architecture reduces heat generation and improves battery life. It charges and discharges with high current in the full temperature range, and is equipped with hardware-level overcurrent and overvoltage double locking protection. It is suitable for complex outdoor working conditions and can operate continuously at full load without the risk of device overheating and failure.",
    "宽频范围内保持低ESR;整机EMC可控；宽温范围内电性能稳定；保证整机户外运行稳定；耐受超大电流冲击，单体电容耐受冲击电流高达30A以上确保高负载高功率的工况下电容能够正常工作且性能稳定。": "Low ESR is maintained in a wide frequency range; the EMC of the whole machine is controllable; the electrical performance is stable in a wide temperature range; the outdoor operation of the whole machine is guaranteed to be stable; it can withstand ultra-large current shocks, and the single capacitor can withstand shock currents up to 30A or more, ensuring that the capacitor can work normally and have stable performance under high load and high power conditions.",
    "高集成度小体积设计适配轻量化需求，低损耗架构降低发热提升续航表现；全温域内大电流充放电，搭载硬件级过流、过压双重锁止保护，适配户外复杂工况，满负载连续运行无器件过热失效风险。": "The highly integrated, small-volume design meets lightweight requirements, and the low-loss architecture reduces heat generation and improves battery life. It charges and discharges with high current in the full temperature range, and is equipped with hardware-level overcurrent and overvoltage double locking protection. It is suitable for complex outdoor working conditions and can operate continuously at full load without the risk of device overheating and failure.",
