    "高功率Buck-Boost混合拓扑": "High Power Buck-Boost Hybrid Topology",
    "① 耐超大电流设计，单体最高30A以上；\n② 宽频范围内保持低ESR;\n③ 导针加粗设计，耐大电流同时抗震性更好；\n④ LKE系列M型封装，抗震设计，可SMT贴片，满足板子结构设计，版面布局 更合理。\n支持超大电流瞬态输出，峰值电流≥30A，适配重载作业场景；全工况下阻抗匹配度≤5mΩ，导通过程无尖峰冲击，搭配SMT贴片化设计缩减整机体积，布局紧凑EMC性能优异。": "① Designed to withstand ultra-high current, the maximum single unit is more than 30A;\n② Maintain low ESR in a wide frequency range;\n③ The thickened design of the guide pin can withstand large currents and has better shock resistance;\n④ LKE series M-type package, anti-seismic design, can be SMT patched, meets the board structure design, and the layout is more reasonable.\nIt supports ultra-large current transient output, with a peak current of ≥30A, suitable for heavy-load operation scenarios; the impedance matching is ≤5mΩ under all working conditions, and there is no peak impact during the conduction process. It is equipped with SMT chip design to reduce the overall size of the machine, and has a compact layout and excellent EMC performance.",
    "① 耐超大电流设计，单体最高30A以上；": "① Designed to withstand ultra-high current, the maximum single unit is more than 30A;",
    "② 宽频范围内保持低ESR;": "② Maintain low ESR in a wide frequency range;",
    "③ 导针加粗设计，耐大电流同时抗震性更好；": "③ The thickened design of the guide pin can withstand large currents and has better shock resistance;",
    "④ LKE系列M型封装，抗震设计，可SMT贴片，满足板子结构设计，版面布局 更合理。": "④ LKE series M-type package, anti-seismic design, can be SMT patched, meets the board structure design, and the layout is more reasonable.",
    "支持超大电流瞬态输出，峰值电流≥30A，适配重载作业场景；全工况下阻抗匹配度≤5mΩ，导通过程无尖峰冲击，搭配SMT贴片化设计缩减整机体积，布局紧凑EMC性能优异。": "It supports ultra-large current transient output, with a peak current of ≥30A, suitable for heavy-load operation scenarios; the impedance matching is ≤5mΩ under all working conditions, and there is no peak impact during the conduction process. It is equipped with SMT chip design to reduce the overall size of the machine, and has a compact layout and excellent EMC performance.",
