    "动态阻抗实时调节，适配不同负载下的功率输出需求，支持多档位功率切换，硬件级过流保护响应时间短，适配冲击钻、电锯等重载电动工具的瞬态大电流工况。": "Dynamic impedance real-time adjustment adapts to power output requirements under different loads, supports multi-level power switching, hardware-level overcurrent protection has short response time, and is suitable for transient high-current conditions of heavy-duty power tools such as impact drills and chainsaws.",
