    "低纹波供电适配高速无刷电机驱动需求，开关损耗降低，整机噪音，支持10万转以上电机稳定运行，全负载范围内高效率，长时间运行无功率衰减。": "The low ripple power supply meets the driving requirements of high-speed brushless motors, reduces switching losses and reduces overall machine noise. It supports stable operation of motors above 100,000 rpm, high efficiency within the full load range, and no power attenuation during long-term operation.",
    "伺服/变频": "Servo/frequency conversion",
