    "低ESR、高容许波电流、小体积大容量，确保整机输出准确且稳定。": "Low ESR, high allowable wave current, small size and large capacity ensure accurate and stable output of the whole machine.",
    "耐受瞬间高电压冲击和大电流冲击等能力，确保整机在峰值功率输出时能够稳定工作；": "The ability to withstand instantaneous high voltage shocks and large current shocks ensures that the whole machine can work stably at peak power output;",
    "三相矢量逆变+前级PFC拓扑模块": "Three-phase vector inverter + front-stage PFC topology module",
    "低纹波、高动态响应带宽设计，小体积大扭矩输出特性优异，全速度区间转速控制精度可达±1rpm；前级主动PFC将功率因数提升至0.98以上，搭配过转矩、过流、编码器异常多重保护，在机床、自动化生产线等工业场景下可实现高精度闭环运动控制，长期运行无丢步、失速问题。": "Low ripple, high dynamic response bandwidth design, small size and large torque output characteristics are excellent, and the speed control accuracy in the entire speed range can reach ±1rpm; the front-stage active PFC increases the power factor to above 0.98, and is equipped with multiple protections for over-torque, over-current, and encoder abnormality. It can achieve high-precision closed-loop motion control in industrial scenarios such as machine tools and automated production lines, and there will be no lost steps or stall problems in long-term operation.",
    "智能家电/智能厨电": "Smart home appliances/smart kitchen appliances",
    "低功耗隔离反激拓扑模块": "Low Power Isolated Flyback Topology Module",
    "待机功耗≤0.5W，适配智能家居低功耗长续航需求，全电压输入范围适配家用市电波动，搭载通讯级隔离设计，支持IoT信号联动，长期运行无静电干扰宕机问题。": "The standby power consumption is ≤0.5W, which meets the low power consumption and long battery life requirements of smart homes. The full voltage input range is suitable for household mains power fluctuations. It is equipped with a communication-level isolation design and supports IoT signal linkage. There is no static interference or downtime problem in long-term operation.",
    "AGV智慧小车": "AGV smart car",
    "多相交错并联拓扑模块": "Multi-phase interleaved parallel topology module",
    "大电流持续输出适配AGV重载行走工况，均流误差≤3%，动态响应速度快，支持快充与续航模式无缝切换，搭配CAN通讯接口实时上传电源状态，保障AGV 7*24小时连续运行。": "The high current continuous output is suitable for AGV heavy-load walking conditions, with a current sharing error of ≤3%, fast dynamic response, and support for seamless switching between fast charging and battery life modes. It is equipped with a CAN communication interface to upload power status in real time to ensure continuous operation of the AGV 7*24 hours.",
    "运动出行": "Sports travel",
    "高功率密度碳化硅拓扑模块": "High power density silicon carbide topology module",
    "小体积轻量化设计适配便携出行设备，SiC器件降低导通损耗，全温域下功率输出稳定，支持快充补能，适配电动滑板、平衡车等设备的动态负载需求。": "The small size and lightweight design is suitable for portable travel equipment. SiC devices reduce conduction losses, and the power output is stable in the full temperature range. It supports fast energy replenishment and adapts to the dynamic load requirements of electric skateboards, balancing scooters and other equipment.",
    "13*20涂膜": "13*20 coating film",
    "14.5*23涂膜": "14.5*23 coating",
    "14.5*25涂膜": "14.5*25 coating film",
    "工业水泵/风机": "Industrial water pump/fan",
    "矢量驱动三相逆变拓扑模块": "Vector drive three-phase inverter topology module",
    "支持V/F无级调速，适配水泵风机的变负载节能运行需求，谐波畸变率≤5%，搭配过转矩保护，全工况下运行平稳无冲击，长期工业环境下可靠性MTBF≥10万小时。": "It supports V/F stepless speed regulation and adapts to the variable load energy-saving operation requirements of water pumps and fans. The harmonic distortion rate is ≤5%. With over-torque protection, the operation is smooth and impact-free under all working conditions. The reliability MTBF in long-term industrial environments is ≥100,000 hours.",
    "12.5*20涂膜": "12.5*20 coating film",
