    "无线充": "Wireless charging",
    "无线充电路拓扑图": "Wireless charging circuit topology diagram",
    "DC-DC开关电源": "DC-DC switching power supply",
    "应用要求：小体积，薄型化，高频低阻，高容量密度，输入端重瞬态补能与浪涌抑制，输出端重纹波平滑与负载补偿\n\n电容作用：充当瞬态电流池为开关管导通提供陡峭脉冲电流，抑制电池内阻引起的电压跌落，同时滤除低频纹波，承担母线平滑与负载补偿，填补环路响应延迟期间的电荷缺口，抑制负载跳变时的电压过冲/下冲“具备极低的ESR特性”，不仅能大幅度降低自身发热，瞬态响应，动态稳压，防止电压跌落，降低输出阻抗，滤除整流后的高频纹波，应对瞬时大电流负载，为负载提供平滑的直流电。\n\n  永铭固态及固液混合电容优势：小型化，薄型化，高容量密度，低ESR、耐大纹波电流能力，降低电能损耗和电容自身发热，提升转换效率；确保在高频纹波电流下稳定工作，减少发热；": "Application requirements: small size, thin profile, high frequency and low resistance, high capacity density, transient energy supply and surge suppression at the input end, ripple smoothing and load compensation at the output end\n\nCapacitance function: Acts as a transient current pool to provide steep pulse current for switch tube conduction, suppresses voltage drops caused by battery internal resistance, filters out low-frequency ripples, undertakes bus smoothing and load compensation, fills the charge gap during the loop response delay, and suppresses the voltage during load jumps Overshoot/undershoot \"has extremely low ESR characteristics\", which can not only greatly reduce self-heating, transient response, dynamic voltage stabilization, prevent voltage drops, reduce output impedance, filter out high-frequency ripples after rectification, cope with instantaneous high-current loads, and provide smooth DC power to the load.\n\n  Advantages of Yongming solid-state and solid-liquid hybrid capacitors: miniaturization, thinness, high capacity density, low ESR, large ripple current resistance, reducing power loss and capacitor self-heating, improving conversion efficiency; ensuring stable operation under high-frequency ripple current and reducing heat generation;",
    "应用要求：小体积，薄型化，高频低阻，高容量密度，输入端重瞬态补能与浪涌抑制，输出端重纹波平滑与负载补偿": "Application requirements: small size, thin profile, high frequency and low resistance, high capacity density, transient energy supply and surge suppression at the input end, ripple smoothing and load compensation at the output end",
    "电容作用：充当瞬态电流池为开关管导通提供陡峭脉冲电流，抑制电池内阻引起的电压跌落，同时滤除低频纹波，承担母线平滑与负载补偿，填补环路响应延迟期间的电荷缺口，抑制负载跳变时的电压过冲/下冲“具备极低的ESR特性”，不仅能大幅度降低自身发热，瞬态响应，动态稳压，防止电压跌落，降低输出阻抗，滤除整流后的高频纹波，应对瞬时大电流负载，为负载提供平滑的直流电。": "Capacitance function: Acts as a transient current pool to provide steep pulse current for switch tube conduction, suppresses voltage drops caused by battery internal resistance, filters out low-frequency ripples, undertakes bus smoothing and load compensation, fills the charge gap during the loop response delay, and suppresses the voltage during load jumps Overshoot/undershoot \"has extremely low ESR characteristics\", which can not only greatly reduce self-heating, transient response, dynamic voltage stabilization, prevent voltage drops, reduce output impedance, filter out high-frequency ripples after rectification, cope with instantaneous high-current loads, and provide smooth DC power to the load.",
    "永铭固态及固液混合电容优势：小型化，薄型化，高容量密度，低ESR、耐大纹波电流能力，降低电能损耗和电容自身发热，提升转换效率；确保在高频纹波电流下稳定工作，减少发热；": "Advantages of Yongming solid-state and solid-liquid hybrid capacitors: miniaturization, thinness, high capacity density, low ESR, large ripple current resistance, reducing power loss and capacitor self-heating, improving conversion efficiency; ensuring stable operation under high-frequency ripple current and reducing heat generation;",
