    "电源输入端需滤波电容以抑制纹波与噪声，保证后续电路稳定工作。": "A filter capacitor is required at the power input end to suppress ripple and noise and ensure stable operation of subsequent circuits.",
    "储能/旁路": "Energy storage/bypass",
    "储能与旁路电容提供瞬态电流支持，减小电源总线波动。": "Energy storage and bypass capacitors provide transient current support and reduce power bus fluctuations.",
    "输出端需滤波电容以平滑电压波形，确保负载端获得纯净电源。": "A filter capacitor is required at the output end to smooth the voltage waveform and ensure that the load end receives pure power.",
    "保护/去耦": "Protection/Decoupling",
    "去耦与保护电容吸收高频噪声和电压尖峰，保障系统EMC合规与长期可靠性。": "Decoupling and protection capacitors absorb high-frequency noise and voltage spikes to ensure system EMC compliance and long-term reliability.",
    "安防": "Security",
    "安防电路拓扑图": "Security circuit topology diagram",
    "应用要求：高压直流母线：核心储能与平滑，在严苛、长寿命的工作条件下，实现安全、稳定、高效的滤波与储能\n 电容作用： 平滑整流后的脉动直流电，为后级提供平稳能量。推荐高耐压400V及以上，大容量，长寿命液态铝电解电容。\n永铭液态电容优势：高容量密度，低漏电流，低阻抗，降低电能损耗和电容自身发热，提升转换效率；确保在高频纹波电流下稳定工作，减少发热；高铝箔耐压，耐大纹波电流耐受度、快速瞬态响应": "Application requirements: High-voltage DC bus: core energy storage and smoothing, achieving safe, stable and efficient filtering and energy storage under harsh, long-life working conditions\n Capacitor function: Smoothes the rectified pulsating DC power to provide stable energy to the subsequent stage. High voltage 400V and above, large capacity, long life liquid aluminum electrolytic capacitors are recommended.\nAdvantages of Yongming liquid capacitors: high capacity density, low leakage current, low impedance, reducing power loss and capacitor self-heating, improving conversion efficiency; ensuring stable operation under high-frequency ripple current, reducing heat generation; high aluminum foil voltage resistance, large ripple current tolerance, and fast transient response",
    "应用要求：高压直流母线：核心储能与平滑，在严苛、长寿命的工作条件下，实现安全、稳定、高效的滤波与储能": "Application requirements: High-voltage DC bus: core energy storage and smoothing, achieving safe, stable and efficient filtering and energy storage under harsh, long-life working conditions",
    "电容作用： 平滑整流后的脉动直流电，为后级提供平稳能量。推荐高耐压400V及以上，大容量，长寿命液态铝电解电容。": "Capacitor function: Smoothes the rectified pulsating DC power to provide stable energy to the subsequent stage. High voltage 400V and above, large capacity, long life liquid aluminum electrolytic capacitors are recommended.",
    "永铭液态电容优势：高容量密度，低漏电流，低阻抗，降低电能损耗和电容自身发热，提升转换效率；确保在高频纹波电流下稳定工作，减少发热；高铝箔耐压，耐大纹波电流耐受度、快速瞬态响应": "Advantages of Yongming liquid capacitors: high capacity density, low leakage current, low impedance, reducing power loss and capacitor self-heating, improving conversion efficiency; ensuring stable operation under high-frequency ripple current, reducing heat generation; high aluminum foil voltage resistance, large ripple current tolerance, and fast transient response",
    "应用要求：低ESR、稳定容量，为电源管理芯片（PWM IC）提供稳定工作电压\n电容作用：为PWM控制芯片提供稳定、纯净的工作电压，小容量，耐压根据芯片供电选择；\n永铭固态叠层电容优势：低ESR，耐大纹波电流及满足IC负载瞬态响应": "Application requirements: low ESR, stable capacity, providing stable operating voltage for power management chip (PWM IC)\nCapacitor function: Provides stable and pure working voltage for PWM control chip, small capacity, withstand voltage selected according to chip power supply;\nAdvantages of Yongming solid laminated capacitors: low ESR, large ripple current resistance and satisfying IC load transient response",
    "应用要求：低ESR、稳定容量，为电源管理芯片（PWM IC）提供稳定工作电压": "Application requirements: low ESR, stable capacity, providing stable operating voltage for power management chip (PWM IC)",
